{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Sojourn in this land.</b> And you — sojourn in the land of Canaan." "<b>And I will be with you and bless you.</b> For even though there is now a lack of pasture in the land of Canaan, I will be with you and you will not lack pasture." "<b>And I will bless you.</b> With wealth and flocks, and not outside the land." "<b>For to you and to your seed I will give, and I will establish the oath.</b> And the reason I said that you should sojourn in this land, and thereby I will benefit you, is that I have already sworn to Abraham to give him and his seed this land. Therefore, when you sojourn in it you will be a prince of Elohim within it, and you will acquire possession in it in order to bequeath it to your seed."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:47.741697368Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}